<title>USA: WellPoint CFO to resign at yearend.</title>
<headline>WellPoint CFO to resign at yearend.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>WellPoint Health Networks Inc Wednesday said Yon Y. Jorden, WellPoint's chief financial officer, will resign at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>As part of the transition process, Jorden will remain CFO until Dec. 31, 1996, and provide consulting services in 1997.</p>
<p>The company said Jorden is leaving for personal reasons.</p>
<p>WellPoint Health Networks Inc. is one of the nation's largest publicly traded managed health-care companies, serving more than 4.2 million medical members.</p>
</text>
